OL,3,GNEWSASizewell C bosses pledge 400 new
OL,4,Ablue-collar jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of blue-collar jobs will be
OL,7,Fcreated as part of an "important
OL,8,Fmilestone" in the development of a new
OL,9,Fnuclear power plant.
OL,11,FSizewell C has awarded security and
OL,12,Ffacilities firm G4S a management
OL,13,Fcontract which is predicted to result
OL,14,Fin the creation of 400 jobs ` many of
OL,15,Fthem in Suffolk.
OL,17,FThe contract, which will last 10 years
OL,18,Fbut includes an option to extend for a
OL,19,Ffurther two years, will begin later
OL,20,Fthis year.
